<title>USA: Iowa-Minn direct weekly average hog weights - USDA.</title>
<headline>Iowa-Minn direct weekly average hog weights - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>DES MOINES 1996-10-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Iowa-Southern Minnesota direct hogs weekly average weights of barrows and gilts for the week ending October 26, 1996, according to the USDA.</p>
<p>Iowa-So Minnesota direct hogs    Receipts   Average Weight/lbs</p>
<p>week ending:  10-26-96		350,000	    252.9</p>
<p>week ending:  10-18-96		350,000	    251.7</p>
<p>year ago:     10-28-1995	    400,000	    251.3</p>
